<p><strong>Real-world analogy:</strong></p>

<p>A degree from a respected university vs. a random online PDF—they look and feel entirely different. One carries heritage and authority; the other… doesn’t.</p>

<p>A familiar crest can help recipients recognize the issuer, but it can also be copied. Verify the record, not just its appearance.</p>

