<h2 id="when-and-why-to-choose-white-labeling">When (and Why) to Choose White Labeling</h2>

<p>There are specific times when you’ll want your credentials to look just right:</p>

<p><strong>✔ University-wide qualifications</strong><br />
    Degrees, minors, diplomas—anything full scale.</p>

<p><strong>✔ Micro-credentials &amp; Continuing Ed</strong><br />
    Short courses, workshops, certifications—ideal for badge-heavy portfolios.</p>

<p><strong>✔ Conferences &amp; Summits</strong><br />
    Your student‑run event, your credentials—in your colors and design.</p>

<p><strong>✔ Extracurricular Programs</strong><br />
    Leadership programs, peer mentoring, student org certifications.</p>

<p><strong>✔ Stackable Certifications</strong><br />
    When modules build toward a larger award, consistency matters.</p>

